WEBVTT

00:06.880 --> 00:08.440
Lucia...

00:08.440 --> 00:09.600
Do you know why you're here?

00:09.600 --> 00:10.920
Bad luck, I guess.

00:57.800 --> 00:59.519
Well look who's back.

01:01.000 --> 01:02.520
The only way...

01:03.000 --> 01:04.560
We're gonna get through this...

01:05.600 --> 01:06.640
Is by sticking together.

01:07.920 --> 01:08.640
Being a team.

01:10.240 --> 01:11.440
Woohoo!

01:13.920 --> 01:14.800
Trust?

01:15.920 --> 01:16.480
Trust.
